- 3 Poison Darts ^3[CS1 Melee]
- 6 Tracking Darts ^3[CS2 Melee]
- Electrical Heavy Melee

^6Inventory: 
- Portable Sentry Gun
- Portable E-Web Turret
- Portable Shield
- Medpac (25HP+)
- Advanced Medpac (50HP+)

^8Attributes:
- Can see allies through walls and their health
- Acid Blood
- Battery Recharge (3)
- Close Combat Training (1)
- 1 Extra Life
- Assemble (1)

^3Abilities:
- Can Heal Others [Hold Use on Allies]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]"